            <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-1.5 space-y-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              <li>Developed COAST, a perception-aware UAV–UGV tracking framework where a single downward-facing aerial camera acts as the ground robot's sole sensor, with an optimal altitude policy balancing track coverage against camera measurement noise.</li>
