          Your download has started for <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-mono">Shlok_Mehndiratta_Resume.pdf</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 text-[11px]">
          This document is compiled directly from the Overleaf LaTeX source repository and contains full academic records, publications, and lab appointments.
